# EcoFlow React Bundle

- Source: `src/ecoflow/`; output: `assets/js/ecoflow-flow.js` (IIFE, do not edit by hand)
- After JS changes: `npm run build:ecoflow` or `npm run dev:ecoflow` (watch)
- Canvas animation in `useFlowCanvas.js`; pause when `document.hidden`
- Data updates via `gamingHubEcoflowStatus` CustomEvent from `ecoflow-dashboard.js`
- PHP initial state: `#ecoflow-energy-flow-root[data-initial]`
